{
  "format": 1,
  "about": "Personal token names and grants (M62.5). Replayed by runtime/client_tokens.rs and the browser mock. Toolset eligibility and whether a toolset writes come only from tools.v1.json. Folder normalization removes repeated ./ prefixes and outer slashes, collapses interior repeated separators, and deduplicates in order. Backslashes and controls are refused so a displayed folder cannot obscure its boundary. Limits count normalized unique folders, Unicode scalar name characters, and UTF-8 folder bytes. Slugs trim after the 32-byte ASCII cut.",
  "limits": {
    "tokens": 20,
    "nameChars": 100,
    "slugChars": 32,
    "folders": 20,
    "folderBytes": 512
  },
